# Charmonium control / peaking background for B+ -> K*+ l+ l-:
# B+ -> J/psi(-> l+ l-) K*+, same visible final state as the signal.
# Mirrors B0_JpsiKst.dec (same SVV_HELAMP amplitudes) with the charged-B
# Upsilon(4S) line and the two K*+ submodes (50/50 = physical ratio; together
# they are 2/3 of K*+ decays, apply that factor at analysis time).

Alias      K*+sig       K*+
Alias      K*-sig       K*-
ChargeConj K*+sig       K*-sig

# J/psisig is already defined in basf2's DECAY_BELLE2.DEC (like B0sig/B+sig),
# so it must not be defined again here.

Decay Upsilon(4S)
0.500  B+sig B-                      VSS;
0.500  B-sig B+                      VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B+sig
1.000  J/psisig K*+sig               SVV_HELAMP 0.6417 3.29 0.7556 0.0 0.1312 0.13;
Enddecay
CDecay B-sig

Decay J/psisig
0.500  e+  e-                        PHOTOS VLL;
0.500  mu+ mu-                       PHOTOS VLL;
Enddecay

Decay K*+sig
0.500  K+    pi0                     VSS;
0.500  K_S0  pi+                     VSS;
Enddecay
CDecay K*-sig

End
